1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:02,860
LokalBot records two tracks,

2
00:00:02,880 --> 00:00:05,000
your microphone and the meeting app.

3
00:00:05,020 --> 00:00:06,630
No bot joins the call.

4
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:09,069
Nemotron tells the voices apart.

5
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:12,060
Qwen3-ASR transcribes each turn,

6
00:00:12,080 --> 00:00:13,537
with its timestamp.

7
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:17,860
Qwen3.5, on the built-in llama.cpp server,

8
00:00:17,880 --> 00:00:20,161
writes the decisions and action items.

9
00:00:20,450 --> 00:00:23,350
It all lands in a local SQLite library,

10
00:00:23,370 --> 00:00:24,690
searchable by keyword,

11
00:00:24,710 --> 00:00:26,890
and by meaning with Harrier.

12
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:29,160
Screen text is opt-in:

13
00:00:29,180 --> 00:00:29,920
read from accessibility,

14
00:00:29,940 --> 00:00:32,603
with OCR as a fallback.

15
00:00:32,850 --> 00:00:34,530
Credentials are redacted,

16
00:00:34,550 --> 00:00:35,990
screenshots encrypted,

17
00:00:36,010 --> 00:00:38,885
and both expire in fourteen days by default.

18
00:00:39,200 --> 00:00:41,448
Search opens the exact moment.

19
00:00:41,750 --> 00:00:44,637
[Meeting] I'll draft the eviction-policy doc by Thursday.

20
00:00:44,950 --> 00:00:46,470
Agents get read-only access

21
00:00:46,490 --> 00:00:48,670
through the CLI and MCP,

22
00:00:48,690 --> 00:00:50,505
off until you turn it on.

23
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:53,300
No account, no telemetry.

24
00:00:53,320 --> 00:00:55,532
Remote servers only with your approval.

25
00:00:55,800 --> 00:00:58,586
LokalBot. Free and open source.
